\title{Finite probability and execution results}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{ledger}

\p{The conclusions depend on their declared probability laws, finite index
sets, positivity conditions, and execution inputs. Changing one of these
assumptions can change the result even when the observed score is unchanged.}
